WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.669 --> 00:00:04.700
It's a day that ends with Y, so you know what
that means: someone on Reddit thinks they

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.080
know what'll happen in the next Avengers movie!

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.900
If you want to ensure that the official trailer
reveal has a zero percent chance of being

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.600
spoiled, click away now.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.380
For those of you who are still here, let's
get started.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:20.180
In the lead-up to the launch of Avengers 4
on May 3rd, 2019, internet gossip and rumors

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.100
spread faster than Spider-Man decides to ditch
school to fight space aliens.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:29.440
But even amid this sea of speculation, directors
Joe and Anthony Russo have all but super-glued

00:00:29.449 --> 00:00:33.569
their mouths shut in efforts to speak as little
as possible about the movie, even going so

00:00:33.569 --> 00:00:37.999
far as to not reveal the film's official title...even
though we're only nine months out from the

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:38.820
movie's release.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.160
But if the latest Internet post to gain traction
is to be believed, all that effort may have

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:43.820
been in vain.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:48.560
The latest bit of Avengers 4 buzz is that
the title and trailer description has reportedly

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:53.069
leaked online months ahead of time posted,
subsequently deleted, and later re-shared

00:00:53.069 --> 00:00:54.480
by several users on Reddit.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:59.319
Yes, if this post is accurate, Marvel Studios'
efforts at secrecy would seem to have been

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.400
an utter failure.

00:01:00.709 --> 00:01:05.460
Fortunately for them, the whole thing sounds
way, way too bonkers to actually be real.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:09.770
The description includes all kinds of exciting,
dramatic details that you'd expect to see

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:11.909
in the Infinity War follow-up's trailer.

00:01:11.909 --> 00:01:15.920
We've got a shot of Thanos' "...damaged Infinity
Gauntlet in a field on the farm planet."

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:20.240
We've got Robert Downey Jr. speaking in voiceover,
saying "We were destined to lose."

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.720
We've even got, quote, an "epic music score."

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:26.600
You know, as opposed to a trailer with a non-epic
music score...like this:

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.720
But those aren't the only details that sound
plausible.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:41.679
We've got M'Baku sitting on the throne in
Wakanda, taking over for T'Challa while he's

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:43.520
nothing more than a pile of dirty leaves.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:47.970
We've got Thor and Valkyrie hanging out on
a Kree ship the kind of space vessel Marvel

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:52.390
fans should expect to know pretty well after
Captain Marvel hits in March of 2019.

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:56.020
We've got Hawkeye in full Ronin gear in Japan,
hanging out with the Yakuza.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:57.400
So far, so possible.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:02.259
So this description has all the general signifiers
you'd expect out of a trailer for the dramatic

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:03.740
and incredible superhero sequel.

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:07.700
But there are also a few other details in
the supposed trailer description that seem

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.640
to throw a whole lot of water on the idea
that it's real.

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:11.730
What kinds of details?

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:14.220
Well, how about the part of the description
where, quote:

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.840
"Rocket and Nebula [are] modifying some new
weapons in the lab.

00:02:17.849 --> 00:02:20.430
Rocket says 'When can we try this bad boy
out?'

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.440
They both smile at each other and fist-bump."

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:25.220
You heard right.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:27.760
According to this post, Rocket and Nebula...fist
bump.

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:28.560
"That's gross."

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:31.120
That's not the only head-scratcher in here.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:35.860
The description says that after the movie's
title is revealed to be "Avengers: Annihilation,"

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:40.270
we'll get a shot of Black Widow, Captain America,
and the Hulk training at a new SHIELD facility:

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:44.880
"Steve notices that Hulk has been training
non-stop as of late, so he asks why.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:49.760
Hulk responds in Banner's normal voice with:
'My rematch is coming real soon, I can feel

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:50.260
it!'"

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:55.760
Those details, among others, have left the
commenters on Reddit to conclude that the

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:57.640
post is pretty far from legit.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:02.200
Highlights of other Redditor's reactions include,
quote, "This is such utterly trash fanfiction

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:06.080
I can't believe anyone thought it was real,"
and "Sounds like something Goku would say."

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:06.960
"Wow!

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:09.120
That guy's awesome!"

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:13.520
And while the addition of Goku to Avengers
4 would probably make the movie about a thousand

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:18.079
times more amazing, it's hard not to agree
that some of the details listed in the description

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.960
do seem a little difficult to believe.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.720
So is this description possibly the real deal?

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:27.000
Or the product of one fan's imagination after
spending months reading rumors and theories

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:27.620
on the Internet?

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:32.240
Either way, in the absence of official trailers
or details from Marvel Studios, random Reddit

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:34.760
threads are pretty much all fans have to go
on.

00:03:34.849 --> 00:03:39.319
The hype for Avengers 4 is crazy high, and
fans are getting tired of waiting for the

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:40.400
movie to hit already.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:44.080
Hopefully we'll get a glimpse of the official
trailer soon, and we can know the truth for

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:44.580
sure.

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:48.400
In the meantime, let's all just get serious
for a second this is probably what the next

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.800
Avengers trailer is going to be like...for
real:

